PROOF_NOTES: PENDING — no live exploit run against caddy:2.7.4 / golang/net v0.14.0 has been
             performed. The CPU and goroutine measurements previously cited were taken against a
             patched image (caddy:2.7.5 / golang/net v0.17.0) and cannot be attributed to the
